  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</a></span> has recently published the official notification regarding the launching of new SSC New Website ssc.gov.in on the official website of SSC. For which the details for SSC OTR One Time Registration Online Form 2025 has been provided on this page. As per the notification released by the SSC, it has been instructed to the aspirants who are applying for the upcoming vacancies in near future that they must have to complete their OTR Registration Process in new website before applying for the SSC New Vacancies. Candidates must check the complete details &amp; process for SSC OTR One Time Registration Online Form 2025 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC OTR Correction Edit Form 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">SSC OTR 2025 | Short Details of Notification</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>22 February 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Aadhar Enable OTR Application Begin :&nbsp;<b>02 June 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Re-Open Edit Existing OTR Date : <strong>19-30 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Registration :&nbsp;<b>NA</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&nbsp;Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">No Age Limit in SSC OTR Registration.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>&nbsp;Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Any Candidates who are going to apply for any of the SSC New Recruitment 2024 can register themselves in SSC New Website which helps to candidates to save their time.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Requisites of Online Application</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Scanned Color Passport Size Photograph in JPEG Format (20KB to 50KB)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Scanned Signature in JPEG Format (20KB to 50KB)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to read the official notification before applying for the particular post</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://hpsc.gov.in or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the SSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for SSC OTR Online Form can read all the information related to the online form is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Popular Vacancy </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Combined Graduate Level CGL Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Selection Post Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Constable GD Recruitment Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Delhi Police Constable Recruitment Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Delhi Police Sub Inspector Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC CPO SI Recruitment Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC CHSL 10+2 Recruitment Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Stenographer Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Junior Engineer JE Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SSC Junior Hindi Translator JHT Exam</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://instagram.com/sarkariexam.com_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-